  "limitations": [
    "These are committed reported results inspected by us, not independently rerun or re-scored in this audit.",
    "No Qwen weight-edit MATH/GSM8K/IFEval capability replication or its original BF16/vLLM evaluation is present.",
    "The presence of copied Exp8 prompts/specifications is not evidence of executing Exp8.",
    "From-zero 20486-parameter game-policy programming does not demonstrate defect localization or improvement of an existing large trained model or HeptaTrader checkpoint.",
    "Three generated networks per shown task, each evaluated for1000 episodes; episodes are not independent weight-edit proposals.",
    "Own API harness, parser and scorer differ from original Codex environment. The authors' three original-networks rescoring is reported close but not identical; exact prompt reuse does not make the whole procedure identical.",
    "API failures excluded and retried; pilots pooled, unequal generation counts, reasoning-effort differences, output truncation handled as failure. Costs are not complete for every model/provider.",
    "Neither categorically proving reasoning rather than recall nor establishing calibrated chance-level behavior follows from a few shuffled/modified-game controls alone.",
    "No complete cost-controlled direct-edit versus newly-trained PPO replication is established; PLAN/SPEC say original PPO checkpoints not released and retraining would be needed.",
    "README F2/F3 extension claims were not audited here; custom-game network/code paths are not part of the public tree inspected."
  ]
